# Applied to the repo-root build context for ha-dev/Dockerfile. BuildKit reads
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the context-root .dockerignore, so
# this keeps node_modules/runtime-state out of the (root) context. The Dockerfile
# also uses only targeted COPYs, so nothing here can leak into the image anyway.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.dev/
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
